382
00:38:10,563 --> 00:38:16,063
僕を見た 全ての女は 魅了され 堕ちていく
All women who look at me are enchanted and fall

383
00:38:16,763 --> 00:38:18,863
女性を魅了する力を手に入れた
I gained the power to charm women

384
00:38:18,863 --> 00:38:21,963
男は一人住む屋敷の地下室に
A man in the basement of his mansion

385
00:38:21,963 --> 00:38:24,763
気に入った女を次々と連れ込み
brought in women he liked one after another

386
00:38:24,763 --> 00:38:27,163
ハーレムを作り上げた
and built a harem

387
00:38:27,863 --> 00:38:32,563
毒を秘めたリビドーの味 突き刺した刃の快楽
The taste of libido harboring poison, the pleasure of a piercing blade

388
00:38:32,863 --> 00:38:38,263
血と汗は混ざり合い やがて 紫の滴へと変わる
Blood and sweat mix together, soon turning into purple droplets

389
00:38:38,563 --> 00:38:43,963
服を脱ぎ捨て抱き合えば 現実へはもう二度と戻れない
If we strip off our clothes and embrace, we can never return to reality

390
00:38:54,763 --> 00:38:59,763
燃やされた昔の肖像画 捨て去った過去の僕
The burned portrait of the past, the past me I threw away

391
00:39:00,363 --> 00:39:05,563
誰しもがあざけ笑った あの顔は忘れたい
Everyone sneered and laughed, I want to forget that face

392
00:39:05,863 --> 00:39:11,563
傍らの可愛い娘を 抱き寄せてキスをする
Pulling the cute girl by my side close, I kiss her

393
00:39:11,763 --> 00:39:17,563
彼女はそう かつて僕のこと 馬鹿にした幼馴染
She is the childhood friend who once made a fool of me

394
00:39:17,563 --> 00:39:20,063
ある日を境にして国中の女が
One day, all the women in the country

395
00:39:20,063 --> 00:39:22,763
いつしか次々と行方をくらませた
somehow vanished one after another

396
00:39:22,763 --> 00:39:25,263
あるものは女房 あるものは娘を
Some lost their wives, some lost their daughters

397
00:39:25,263 --> 00:39:28,363
失い途方に暮れた
and were left in utter despair

398
00:39:28,863 --> 00:39:33,263
闇に染まるリビドーの色 とどまらぬ無限の情欲
The color of libido dyed in darkness, boundless and unstoppable lust

399
00:39:33,563 --> 00:39:39,263
幻想は全てを呑み込み 僕はもう人ではなくなる
Illusion swallows everything, and I am no longer human

400
00:39:39,563 --> 00:39:44,263
神に逆らい堕落する これが僕の望んでた狂気のnight
Rebelling against God and falling into depravity, this is the madness of the night I wished for

401
00:40:07,108 --> 00:40:09,288
今日もまた美しい淑女が
Today, too, a beautiful lady

402
00:40:09,288 --> 00:40:11,688
僕の元 訪れる
visits me.

403
00:40:12,308 --> 00:40:14,608
さあおいで 僕の胸の中
Come into my chest,

404
00:40:14,608 --> 00:40:16,808
踊ろうよ このハーレムで
let's dance in this harem.

405
00:40:17,708 --> 00:40:19,908
近づいた 貴方を抱きしめ
Embracing you as you drew close,

406
00:40:19,908 --> 00:40:22,408
微笑んだ その瞬間
the moment you smiled,

407
00:40:23,008 --> 00:40:25,908
突然の 鋭い痛みと
with a sudden sharp pain,

408
00:40:25,908 --> 00:40:28,708
血に染まる 僕の胸
my chest is dyed with blood.

409
00:40:29,408 --> 00:40:31,708
消えた恋人を捜していた若者
A young man searching for his missing lover

410
00:40:31,708 --> 00:40:34,308
居場所を突き止めた 悪魔の住む屋敷
pinpointed the mansion where the devil lives.

411
00:40:34,708 --> 00:40:36,908
若者は女装して悪魔に近づいた
The young man dressed as a woman to approach the devil,

412
00:40:36,908 --> 00:40:39,908
懐の刀を悪魔に突き刺した
and thrust the dagger in his bosom into the devil.

413
00:40:40,408 --> 00:40:43,308
毒を秘めた刀がささり
The dagger containing poison pierced,

414
00:40:43,308 --> 00:40:45,608
僕はその場に倒れこんだ
and I collapsed on the spot.

415
00:40:45,808 --> 00:40:48,808
血と汗は混ざり合い やがて
Blood and sweat mix, and eventually

416
00:40:48,808 --> 00:40:51,408
紫の滴へと変わっていく
turn into purple droplets.

417
00:40:51,508 --> 00:40:56,308
術のとけた女たちは全て 我に帰り屋敷から逃げ出した
All the women whose spells were broken fled the mansion.

418
00:40:56,808 --> 00:40:59,308
僕のこと 一瞬だけ見て
Looking at me for just a second,

419
00:40:59,308 --> 00:41:02,108
最後に屋敷から出たのは
the last one to leave the mansion was

420
00:41:02,108 --> 00:41:04,908
あの幼馴染 待ってよ
that childhood friend. Wait,

421
00:41:04,908 --> 00:41:08,108
まだ君に好きだと言ってない
I haven't told you yet that I love you.

422
00:41:56,704 --> 00:42:01,984
Well, how did I allow myself to be talked into this quest?

423
00:42:02,284 --> 00:42:05,984
To suffer the odious hijinks of these bumbling fools.

424
00:42:06,984 --> 00:42:10,484
A crude, unsightly, and boorish lot they are.

425
00:42:10,984 --> 00:42:17,484
Me thinks they could scarce walk a straight line, much less perform — oh, God forbid — dance.
Me thinks they could scarce walk a straight line, much less perform—oh, God forbid—dance.

426
00:42:19,484 --> 00:42:24,484
Their company doth abase me, who should be foremost among my peers.

427
00:42:24,984 --> 00:42:30,984
Humble bard I may be, but the world shall soon know of my eminence and fawn and adore me as they should.

428
00:42:31,484 --> 00:42:34,984
I may yet be unknown, but soon...

429
00:42:35,484 --> 00:42:41,484
...once this silly quest is over and I have my wish, townsfolk will swoon over my ballads.

430
00:42:41,484 --> 00:42:45,984
Royalty will beg me to grace their parties.

431
00:42:45,984 --> 00:42:51,984
In the name of Hexa shall ring over Hill and Valley as the greatest performer this realm hath ever known.

432
00:42:51,984 --> 00:42:54,984
And then... and then...

433
00:42:57,684 --> 00:43:00,984
Say, is there anybody out there that wants to perform?

434
00:43:01,484 --> 00:43:05,984
Is there none who dare take the stage? What, have you missed?

435
00:43:06,484 --> 00:43:09,984
I see thee tap in thy feet to all the songs. Dost thou dance, dance?

436
00:43:10,484 --> 00:43:12,984
Ah, me? Ah, I don't know.

437
00:43:13,984 --> 00:43:18,284
Hey, please give us a song, miss! And we'll make us the thing I sing.

438
00:43:18,984 --> 00:43:21,984
Well, thou art dressed like a singer. So a singer's god doth a singer make.

439
00:43:25,484 --> 00:43:26,984
Very well. I'll do it.

440
00:43:28,984 --> 00:43:35,484
Good evening, ladies and gentlemen. Are you ready for the greatest performance of your lives?

441
00:44:03,984 --> 00:44:09,984
Once in a faraway, faraway world was a collar that coiled like a snake

442
00:44:10,284 --> 00:44:16,284
I want someone please - I need someone please Oh, I listened close as it howled in ache
I want someone please—I need someone please. Oh, I listened close as it howled in ache.

443
00:44:16,684 --> 00:44:21,984
Please don't be angry and please don't abandon me. Don't leave me here on my own (kay?)

444
00:44:22,484 --> 00:44:28,984
It wrapped itself tightly, daily and nightly - only with praise would it loosen it's hold
It wrapped itself tightly, daily and nightly—only with praise would it loosen its hold.

445
00:44:29,284 --> 00:44:31,984
I placed in the top of my class~

446
00:44:32,284 --> 00:44:35,284
there's no one left for me to surpass

447
00:44:35,484 --> 00:44:38,284
Don't I look cute in this dress?

448
00:44:38,484 --> 00:44:43,984
I really, really must confess - it's tightening 'round my neck!
I really, really must confess—it's tightening 'round my neck!

449
00:44:44,984 --> 00:44:50,984
Give me your love, all of your love, give me your love - all you can conjur up
Give me your love, all of your love, give me your love—all you can conjure up.

450
00:44:50,984 --> 00:44:57,284
Give me your love, all of your love, till you go mad with ecstasy

451
00:44:57,484 --> 00:45:01,484
All of the hurt, all of the ache - help me escape! Take it, oh take it away!!!
All of the hurt, all of the ache—help me escape! Take it, oh take it away!!!

452
00:45:00,965 --> 00:45:02,965
All of the hurt, all of the ache -

453
00:45:02,965 --> 00:45:05,265
help me escape! Take it, oh take it away!

454
00:45:06,665 --> 00:45:11,165
Is there no end to this pain?

455
00:45:40,765 --> 00:45:46,965
Grow as you may, but the necklace will stay just as small as the day it was found

456
00:45:47,765 --> 00:45:53,165
It's so suffocating, the endless placating - no one is, no one is ever enough!

457
00:45:53,965 --> 00:45:59,165
Won't lose to anyone, always ranked number one, aren't I a beautiful child? (Hey)

458
00:45:59,665 --> 00:46:06,065
I'm better than her - I'm better than him, oh everyone, come round and gawk at perfection!

459
00:46:06,765 --> 00:46:09,165
Meeting you right after school,

460
00:46:09,165 --> 00:46:12,065
I'm finally confessing to you -

461
00:46:12,065 --> 00:46:15,065
Ain't it too good to be true?

462
00:46:15,865 --> 00:46:20,965
A girl, like me, in love with you - who's miserable, vulgar, and crude!

463
00:46:22,165 --> 00:46:27,865
Give me your love, all of your love, give me your love - You can have everything

464
00:46:27,865 --> 00:46:33,965
if I have you, I can have you - shoulder my load, now yours to behold

465
00:46:34,665 --> 00:46:39,565
Still not enough, you're not enough - never enough.

466
00:46:39,565 --> 00:46:43,465
Still I won't loosen my hold

467
00:46:43,965 --> 00:46:46,565
Truly, I'm so sorry.

468
00:46:46,865 --> 00:46:52,865
Give me your love, all of your love, give me your love - all you can conjure up

469
00:46:52,865 --> 00:46:59,365
Give me your love, all of your love, till you go mad with ecstasy

470
00:46:59,665 --> 00:47:08,365
I know it hurts - (it) only gets worse - God how it hurts - Soon you'll be craving the pain

471
00:47:08,865 --> 00:47:18,165
This is my happiness now!

472
00:47:33,865 --> 00:47:39,665
This is my happiness now!

473
00:48:14,265 --> 00:48:17,865
I know not how thou fared, but I was successful in my adventure.

474
00:48:18,165 --> 00:48:20,565
More trinkets for thy thrift shop?

475
00:48:20,765 --> 00:48:27,465
Nay, 'twas coin we needed. I merely took out a small loan from the bank. They shan't mind.

476
00:48:28,065 --> 00:48:35,065
I acquired some healing potions. Luckily, 'twas a simple matter to trade for some of these jewels I found in the woods.

477
00:48:35,765 --> 00:48:37,165
Thou liar!

478
00:48:37,165 --> 00:48:41,865
'Twas thou who took my bag!

479
00:48:41,865 --> 00:48:45,665
Thou misapprehendest this from me; I merely found these lying on the floor of the forest.

480
00:48:45,665 --> 00:48:50,465
Mayhaps there was a bag? Confess about stealing my stuff!

481
00:48:50,665 --> 00:48:55,065
Does every bag that happens to fall in the wood belong to thee? I reason is always acting selfishly. She's the newest, so 'twas probably her.

482
00:49:00,165 --> 00:49:00,565
Thou darest to accuse me?!

483
00:49:02,165 --> 00:49:09,165
If thou were truly innocent, would the thief not more likely be Hexa? She is simple and craven, and acted half-mad back there in the forest.

484
00:49:11,665 --> 00:49:14,665
Me? Why art thou accusing me?

485
00:49:14,865 --> 00:49:18,165
It could be none but Failing with her strange obsession with Namu.

486
00:49:18,665 --> 00:49:20,465
Thy words ring true.

487
00:49:20,665 --> 00:49:23,165
Can I just have the bag thou foundst in the forest?

488
00:49:23,365 --> 00:49:25,065
Nay, 'tis mine!

489
00:49:27,665 --> 00:49:33,465
I knew it was folly to undertake this quest with you all. Fie on you! Fie on you all!

490
00:49:34,465 --> 00:49:38,865
Myself, all on thee! Thou wentest on a witless womanizer!

491
00:49:38,965 --> 00:49:47,965
I saw thy pathetic attempts at charming innocent choir girls! Better to apply thy sorcery upon thyself, that thou might vanish to the betterment of the world.

492
00:49:48,165 --> 00:49:54,665
Me? My romantic diversions deserve no concern to thee! Thou uncouth, my cake-faced rat!

493
00:49:55,665 --> 00:50:02,165
Trust to thou and be my companions of flesh, with thine erratic figments and dreams.

494
00:50:02,665 --> 00:50:04,565
Have ye all forgotten about our quest?

495
00:50:04,867 --> 00:50:06,497
Why aren't thou in such a rush to go?
Why art thou in such a rush to go?

496
00:50:06,497 --> 00:50:09,657
Dost thou steal it? Certainly not.

497
00:50:09,657 --> 00:50:15,197
Only want us to continue our quest and not linger on this useless bickering.
I only want us to continue our quest and not linger on this useless bickering.

498
00:50:15,827 --> 00:50:19,337
You two have been fighting or sticking to each other this whole time.

499
00:50:19,767 --> 00:50:23,277
Make up your mind already. Do you like each other?

500
00:50:23,797 --> 00:50:25,767
We like each other. Do we not, Nanomu?

501
00:50:25,947 --> 00:50:31,227
If twas thou who stole my bag, then no, I don't like thee.

502
00:50:31,467 --> 00:50:32,467
Really?

503
00:50:32,657 --> 00:50:36,657
Look what thou hast done! Thou strucken her with a! Thou hast wounded her!
Look what thou hast done! Thou hast strucken her! Thou hast wounded her!

504
00:50:45,530 --> 00:50:48,880
時の揺りかごで
In the cradle of time,

505
00:50:49,080 --> 00:50:52,130
冷たい夢を見る
I dream a cold dream.

506
00:50:52,430 --> 00:50:56,330
君が歌ってくれた
The lullaby you softly sang

507
00:50:56,630 --> 00:51:01,330
優しい 優しい 子守唄
So gentle, so gentle...

508
00:51:01,530 --> 00:51:04,480
君が望んだのは? 終わらぬ世界
What was it you wished for? An unending world.

509
00:51:04,480 --> 00:51:08,130
俺が望むのは 世界の終わり...?
What I wish for... the end of the world...?

510
00:51:08,230 --> 00:51:12,430
選ばれし声は 迷い、憂い 笑顔、労り
The chosen voice is lost in sorrow,

511
00:51:12,880 --> 00:51:16,130
歌う 悲しみを 苦しみを
Singing, turning sorrow and suffering

512
00:51:16,980 --> 00:51:20,480
喜びにと 笑顔に変えて
Into joy and smiles...

513
00:51:20,880 --> 00:51:28,430
報われずに 君は朽ちていくのか? ただ、祈る 守りたい、この世界
Will you rot away unrewarded? I only pray, wanting to protect this world.

514
00:51:28,680 --> 00:51:32,830
想いは 交わらない
Our feelings will never cross.

515
00:51:33,680 --> 00:51:41,230
命を この手で全て、終わらせたい 巡る世界に やすらぎと祝福を
I want to end all life with my own hands—granting peace and blessing to this revolving world—

516
00:51:41,230 --> 00:51:48,430
ああ 届かない 伝わらないよ 願いは虚しさだけを残して
Ah, it won't reach, it won't get through. My wish leaves behind only emptiness.

517
00:51:49,130 --> 00:51:52,530
始まる 何故? 全て奪われ 未来を照らして
It begins. Why? Everything is taken. Illuminate the future—

518
00:51:52,830 --> 00:51:59,330
痛み、苦しみ、背負わざれても... 永遠に続くレクイエム 抗えない運命を
Even if forced to bear pain and suffering... an eternal requiem. Against an inescapable destiny—

519
00:51:59,530 --> 00:52:03,780
光を、運命を、全て今、解き放つ 闇を 解き放つ
Release the light, release fate now, release the darkness—

520
00:52:36,130 --> 00:52:39,680
君が望んだのは? あなたの未来
What was it you wished for? Your future.

521
00:52:39,680 --> 00:52:43,380
俺が望んだのは...何故? 戻らぬあの日...?
What I wished for... Why? That day that won't return...?

522
00:52:43,830 --> 00:52:48,880
追い続けたのは 優しい笑顔 それだけなのに
All I kept chasing was that gentle smile, yet even so...

523
00:52:49,480 --> 00:52:56,330
絶望を、希望に変えて 終わらない歌声を 叫び続けて 滅びの運命なら ただ、祈る
Turn despair into hope, an unending song. Keep screaming; if destruction is our fate, I only pray—

524
00:52:56,880 --> 00:52:59,880
せめて今、弔いの 果てしくなく 遠く遠く
At least now, a mourning prayer, endlessly, far away...

525
00:53:00,180 --> 00:53:04,380
歌よ 響け
Song, resonate!

526
00:53:07,530 --> 00:53:14,630
巡り 巡る 世界に やすらぎと 祝福を 光を、運命を、闇を、解き放て
Grant peace and blessing to the revolving world. Release the light, fate, and darkness!

527
00:53:21,830 --> 00:53:29,080
終わらない 絶望を 歌声を、希望に変えて 叫び続けて ただ祈る 君は朽ちていくの?
Turn endless despair and song into hope. Keep screaming, just praying. Will you rot away?

528
00:53:29,080 --> 00:53:32,380
せめて今、弔いの 果てしくなく、遠く 遠く
At least now, a mourning prayer, endlessly, far away...

529
00:53:32,380 --> 00:53:36,180
歌よ 響け
Song, resonate!

530
00:53:37,130 --> 00:53:42,930
君が望んだのは... 俺が望んだのは...
What you wished for... What I wished for...

531
00:53:43,580 --> 00:53:49,980
残された 声は 嘆き 君を想いながら
The voice left behind is a sigh, thinking of you.

532
00:53:50,580 --> 00:53:58,680
独り、君のために歌う 独り、君のために歌う
Alone, I sing for you. Alone, I sing for you.

533
00:53:59,580 --> 00:54:06,530
命を この手で全て、眠らせたら 巡る世界に やすらぎと祝福を
If I put all life to sleep with my own hands—granting peace and blessing to this revolving world—

534
00:54:06,630 --> 00:54:12,530
ああ、朽ちていく 運命は終わり この身は 君となら どこまで でも...
Ah, rotting away, fate comes to an end. This body, if with you, will go anywhere...

535
00:54:12,680 --> 00:54:19,330
始まる声 全て 叶えて 未来を照らして 滅び、散り行く この身とともに 永遠に続くレクイエム
Grant every starting voice, illuminate the future. Along with this body perishing and scattering, an eternal requiem.

536
00:54:19,680 --> 00:54:26,530
抗えない運命を 光を、運命を、全て今、解き放ち 闇を 解き放ち
Against an inescapable destiny, release the light, release fate now, release the darkness—

537
00:54:26,680 --> 00:54:32,680
光の 底に、 眠れ
Sleep at the bottom of the light.

538
00:54:59,105 --> 00:55:01,235
Where is the Dark Lord?

539
00:55:01,525 --> 00:55:02,985
Dark Lord, reveal thyself! We are here to defeat...

540
00:55:03,758 --> 00:55:04,758
3, 2, 1

541
00:55:08,235 --> 00:55:09,435
How queer.

542
00:55:10,735 --> 00:55:12,385
The silence, it's...

543
00:55:13,135 --> 00:55:15,385
Says who? This room was empty.

544
00:55:15,935 --> 00:55:18,285
From the very beginning.

545
00:55:18,985 --> 00:55:20,985
Why'd it be?

546
00:55:53,635 --> 00:55:56,135
The quest began at the cusp of dawn

547
00:55:59,135 --> 00:56:02,635
Blank map in hand eager to be drawn

548
00:56:03,535 --> 00:56:05,635
Cascading secrets

549
00:56:06,135 --> 00:56:10,135
Holding onto wishes untold

550
00:56:11,135 --> 00:56:17,135
With every stride, a new tale bound to unfold

551
00:56:19,635 --> 00:56:21,635
In realms never seen

552
00:56:22,635 --> 00:56:25,635
In planes beyond belief

553
00:56:26,635 --> 00:56:30,635
Smiles beamed and gleamed radiantly

554
00:56:31,135 --> 00:56:35,135
Wonders hidden with each turn

555
00:56:35,635 --> 00:56:37,135
Always together

556
00:56:37,635 --> 00:56:43,635
In harmony, all perils can be weathered

557
00:56:45,635 --> 00:56:50,135
A melody chases the laughter of five

558
00:56:50,635 --> 00:56:56,635
